T Test square + axle
! frame
C A W8 0,0,0 z x
C B W8 2,0,0 z x
C Cc W8 2,2,0 z x
C Dd W8 0,2,0 z x
R A B
R B Cc
R Cc Dd
R Dd A
R A Cc          # diagonal 2*sqrt2 = yellow
! axle through B and Dd
R 1,-1,0 1,3,0 red     # axle along y at x=1 (4 U = red) - should collide with rods? passes between
H M W8 1,1,0 x          # connector hub on the axle at the centre (also where the diagonal passes!)
